title HUNK15 — the Skate view of a revert (preview_revert)
prompt Autonomous recursion lap: continue the Season-A Photos journey Lindy-first crux-first after HUNK14 sent; land a clean self-contained increment, send it as its own signed round, stop at custody gates.
think After HUNK14 (the revert as pure data) sent, the crux options were another Photos verb (touches the proven photos.rye + photo_edits.rye), the Skate view of a revert (pure composition, no proven file touched), or a revert/redo cursor. Chose the Skate view of a revert: it completes the revert story visibly and is low-risk pure composition over HUNK13's preview and HUNK14's drop_last.
think preview_revert drops the last k edits then hands the shorter list to edit_preview.preview — so it reuses two proven seams and adds no new failure mode. Reverting all the way previews the empty list's own down-map, i.e. the original image; a keeper sees what "revert to original" restores without any reconstruction.
think Symlinked photo_revert.rye into brushstroke/ so imports resolve beside the existing qoi/photo_edits/photos/image_skate/skate_grid links; touched no proven file.
obs Chose proofs that make correctness unambiguous over an 8×8 two-tone: the restored view equals the source down-map cell-for-cell (left cell blue→red), a revert of zero is the full view, an over-count revert clamps to the original, the input list survives (pure), deterministic, and — a genuinely new property — reverting away an out-of-bounds crop RESCUES a list that refused when previewed whole, previewing cleanly. A revert removes the failure.
obs Hit the known apostrophe-in-GREEN-line shell trap (HUNK5/HUNK13 saw it): the selftest printed GREEN but the single-quoted grep broke on "source's" and "caller's". Reworded both to "source down-map" and "input list", witness grep realigned; GREEN on the re-run.
obs No custody gate reached — pure look over the edit-list, no name, no bead, no key, no funds, no network. HUNK13 and HUNK14 witnesses still GREEN beneath.
loom witness=hunk_revert_preview_witness image=8x8 grid=2x2 lit=256 result=GREEN
